<!-- SECTION 1: EXECUTIVE SUMMARY -->
<h2>1. Executive Summary & Brand Philosophy</h2>
<p>
  <strong>Daiva Cosmetics (Aura Luxe Cosmetics)</strong> is a luxury, clean-beauty direct-to-consumer (D2C) e-commerce application designed to provide an ultra-high-end shopping experience inspired by international luxury skincare brands (such as Sephora, Aesop, and Charlotte Tilbury).
</p>
<p>
  The project combines botanical luxury aesthetics with enterprise-grade supply chain infrastructure. Unlike traditional mock e-commerce storefronts, Daiva Cosmetics features deep backend integrations including cryptographic payment verification, batch-level inventory tracking with expiry dates, multi-address profile management, dynamic Xpressbees courier serviceability, Amazon-style verified customer photo reviews with profanity checking, and real-time customer browsing history.
</p>

<!-- SECTION 2: DESIGN SYSTEM, TYPOGRAPHY & COLOR PALETTE -->
<h2>2. Design System: Typography, Colors & Themes</h2>
<p>
  The entire application is built on a custom design system meticulously calibrated for both <strong>Light Mode</strong> (Clean Luxury Spa aesthetic) and <strong>Dark Mode</strong> (Opulent Midnight Boudoir aesthetic).
</p>

