<!-- SECTION 3: SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE -->
<h2>3. System Architecture & Tech Stack</h2>
<div class="callout">
  <strong>Decoupled Client-Server Architecture:</strong>
  Vite React Single Page Application (SPA) communicating over REST JSON APIs with an enterprise Spring Boot backend, proxying development traffic smoothly and executing cryptographically signed actions.
</div>

<table class="data-table">
  <tr>
    <th>Layer</th>
    <th>Technology Stack</th>
    <th>Key Responsibilities</th>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><strong>Frontend SPA</strong></td>
    <td>React 18.3, TypeScript 5.5, Vite 6, Tailwind CSS 3.4, Lucide Icons</td>
    <td>Client-side routing, real-time context management, animations, responsive layouts, client validation.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><strong>Backend API</strong></td>
    <td>Java 21, Spring Boot 3.3.4, Spring Data JPA, Embedded Tomcat 10</td>
    <td>REST endpoints, business validation, inventory transactions, cryptographic verification, audit logging.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><strong>Database</strong></td>
    <td>H2 Relational Database 2.2 (Disk File: <code>./data/cosmeticsdb.mv.db</code>)</td>
    <td>ACID transaction persistence for Products, Batches, Orders, Users, Addresses, Reviews, History.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><strong>Logistics Integration</strong></td>
    <td>Xpressbees B2C Shipping API + Fallback Serviceability Matrix</td>
    <td>Pincode serviceability check, AWB generation, multi-checkpoint tracking simulation.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><strong>Payment Integration</strong></td>
    <td>Razorpay API + Cryptographic HMAC-SHA256 Signature Verification</td>
    <td>Order creation, UPI QR generation, card simulation, signature security verification.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><strong>ERP / CRM</strong></td>
    <td>Zoho Inventory & Books REST APIs</td>
    <td>Item synchronization, sales order sync, real-time connection status monitoring.</td>
  </tr>
</table>

<!-- SECTION 4: USER-FACING STOREFRONT PAGES & FEATURES -->
<h2>4. Storefront Pages & Customer Features</h2>

<h3>4.1 Header & Global Navigation (<code>Navbar.tsx</code>)</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Top Value Banner:</strong> Sticky notification highlighting free shipping threshold (>₹999) and 100% clean botanical formulation pledge.</li>
  <li><strong>Live Product Search:</strong> Debounced query search (250ms) querying backend database with instant thumbnail results and pricing.</li>
  <li><strong>Active PLP Category Pointer:</strong> Visual indicator pointing directly to the currently active cosmetic category (Serums, Moisturizers, Lip Care, Sun Care, Cleansers).</li>
  <li><strong>Theme Toggle:</strong> 1-click switcher between Light Mode (Luxe Cream) and Dark Mode (Espresso Dark), persisted in local storage.</li>
  <li><strong>Quick Access Badges:</strong>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>User Profile:</strong> Fast access to account or direct Sign In modal.</li>
      <li><strong>Saved Wishlist:</strong> Real-time animated counter of wishlisted cosmetics.</li>
      <li><strong>Browsing History:</strong> Quick clock icon counter displaying recently viewed products.</li>
      <li><strong>Cart Drawer Trigger:</strong> Shopping bag badge with animated bounce count.</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
  <li><strong>Mobile Drawer Menu:</strong> Fully responsive off-canvas hamburger navigation.</li>
</ul>

<h3>4.2 Home Page (<code>HomePage.tsx</code>)</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Hero Banner:</strong> High-fashion editorial photography showcasing seasonal botanical product drops with direct "Shop Clean Beauty" CTA.</li>
  <li><strong>Brand Philosophy Badges:</strong> Certified Vegan, 100% Cruelty-Free, Dermatologically Tested, Ayurvedic & Swiss Botanicals.</li>
  <li><strong>Curated Regimens:</strong> Dedicated product collections grouped by skin concerns (Radiance, Deep Hydration, Anti-Pollution).</li>
  <li><strong>Best Sellers Showcase:</strong> Live grid pulling highest-rated cosmetics with real-time stock levels.</li>
  <li><strong>Newsletter VIP Club:</strong> Subscriber capture form with coupon incentive.</li>
</ul>

<h3>4.3 Product Listing Page (<code>PLPPage.tsx</code>)</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Multi-Dimensional Filters:</strong>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Category Filter:</strong> Serums & Treatments, Moisturizers, Lip Care & Makeup, Sun Care, Cleansers.</li>
      <li><strong>Skin Type Filter:</strong> All Skin Types, Oily/Acne-Prone, Dry/Sensitive, Combination.</li>
      <li><strong>Price Range Slider:</strong> Real-time dynamic dual-range price filtering.</li>
      <li><strong>Sorting Options:</strong> Newest, Price: Low to High, Price: High to Low, Highest Customer Rating.</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
  <li><strong>Compact Luxury Product Cards:</strong> Optimized proportional card sizes preventing screen overflow.</li>
  <li><strong>Easy Cart Inline Action:</strong> Adding to cart from PLP does NOT aggressively open the cart drawer; instead, it morphs into an animated increment/decrement quantity pill directly on the product card.</li>
  <li><strong>Stock Badges:</strong> "Bestseller", "Featured", "Low Stock (<10 left)", and "Sold Out".</li>
  <li><strong>Instant Wishlist Toggle:</strong> Floating heart button with immediate feedback.</li>
</ul>

<h3>4.4 Product Detail Page (<code>PDPPage.tsx</code>)</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Multi-Angle Gallery & Lightbox:</strong> Zoom-enabled product gallery with high-resolution modal preview.</li>
  <li><strong>Botanical Formula Breakdown:</strong> Accordion tabs detailing Key Active Ingredients, Clinical Benefits, and How to Apply.</li>
  <li><strong>Amazon-Style Verified Customer Reviews:</strong>
    <ul>
      <li>Rating breakdown distribution (5-star down to 1-star percentage bars).</li>
      <li>Verified Buyer badges ensuring integrity.</li>
      <li>Customer photo attachments with full-screen lightbox preview.</li>
      <li>Client-side and backend profanity detection stopping abusive submissions.</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
  <li><strong>Complementary Ritual Recommendations:</strong> Algorithmic product pairing suggestions based on complementary subcategories.</li>
  <li><strong>Recently Viewed Cosmetics Carousel:</strong> Automatically tracks browsing history and displays products previously inspected.</li>
</ul>

<h3>4.5 Shopping Bag & Cart Drawer (<code>CartDrawer.tsx</code> & <code>CartPage.tsx</code>)</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>No-Scroll Background Lock:</strong> Fixes webpage background scrolling when customer navigates inside the drawer.</li>
  <li><strong>Complimentary Shipping Meter:</strong> Dynamic progress bar showing how much more is needed to reach the ₹999 free shipping goal.</li>
  <li><strong>Quantity Controls & Deletion:</strong> 1-click stepper with automatic total recalculation.</li>
  <li><strong>Summary Calculation:</strong> Subtotal, GST taxes (18% inclusive/breakdown), shipping fee calculation, and grand total.</li>
</ul>

<h3>4.6 Saved Wishlist (<code>WishlistPage.tsx</code>)</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Grid of saved covetable cosmetics stored in the database for logged-in users and cached locally for guests.</li>
  <li><strong>Move to Bag:</strong> 1-click migration from wishlist straight into the active cart.</li>
  <li><strong>Move All to Bag:</strong> Batch migration tool automatically moving all in-stock items with one click.</li>
</ul>

<h3>4.7 Customer Browsing History (<code>HistoryPage.tsx</code>)</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Persistent viewing history saved both in database table <code>user_browsing_history</code> and <code>localStorage</code>.</li>
  <li><strong>Relative Timestamps:</strong> Displays "Just now", "15m ago", "2h ago", "Yesterday".</li>
  <li><strong>Individual & Bulk Clearing:</strong> Remove individual cards or clear entire history with 1 click.</li>
  <li><strong>Quick Purchase Actions:</strong> Add directly to cart or save to wishlist from browsing history.</li>
</ul>

<h3>4.8 Multi-Address Profile Portal (<code>ProfilePage.tsx</code>)</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Multi-Address Model:</strong>
    <ul>
      <li>Supports <code>HOME</code>, <code>OFFICE</code>, and <code>OTHER</code> address types with distinctive visual color badges.</li>
      <li>1-click <strong>Set as Default</strong> address, ensuring future orders pre-select this address automatically.</li>
      <li>Full CRUD: Add New Address modal, Edit existing address, and Delete.</li>
      <li>Automatic synchronization with user profile entity in backend.</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
  <li><strong>Tabbed Customer Dashboard:</strong>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Orders Tab:</strong> Full history of placed orders, payment status, tracking buttons, and verified review writer.</li>
      <li><strong>Recently Viewed Tab:</strong> In-portal access to recently browsed products.</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
  <li><strong>Animated Live Courier Journey (Xpressbees Tracking):</strong>
    <ul>
      <li>Real-time visual timeline: Order Placed → Packed & Manifested → In Transit → Out for Delivery → Delivered.</li>
      <li>Animated bouncing delivery van with rolling wheels and road dash animations.</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>

<h3>4.9 Checkout & Payment Confirmation (<code>CheckoutPage.tsx</code>)</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Dynamic Delivery Destination:</strong> Eliminates hardcoded fake addresses. Displays user's saved Home and Office addresses as 1-click selectable radio cards.</li>
  <li><strong>Add Address Inline:</strong> "+ Add New Address" modal dialog right inside checkout without leaving the payment flow.</li>
  <li><strong>Live Pincode Serviceability (Xpressbees):</strong> Automatically verifies 6-digit Indian PIN codes, calculating courier delivery days, COD eligibility, and express routes.</li>
  <li><strong>Payment Options:</strong>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> Instant order confirmation with pending payment status.</li>
      <li><strong>Razorpay Live & Sandbox:</strong> Integrated Razorpay checkout with UPI (Google Pay, PhonePe, Paytm, CRED), Credit/Debit Cards, and NetBanking.</li>
      <li><strong>Interactive Razorpay Simulator:</strong> Built-in sandbox modal simulating authentic UPI QR scans and card authorizations with real cryptographic HMAC-SHA256 signature verification.</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
  <li><strong>Digital Order Invoice:</strong> Downloadable and printable order confirmation receipt.</li>
</ul>

<!-- SECTION 5: ADMIN MANAGEMENT & CONTROL PORTAL -->
<h2>5. Admin Portal: Capabilities & Controls (<code>AdminPage.tsx</code>)</h2>
<p>
  Accessed via <code>#admin</code> by users with the <code>ADMIN</code> role. A comprehensive back-office operations suite designed for inventory managers, store administrators, and logistics dispatchers.
</p>

<h3>5.1 Executive KPI Metrics Dashboard</h3>
<table class="data-table">
  <tr>
    <th>Metric Card</th>
    <th>Data Source / Calculation</th>
    <th>Operational Purpose</th>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><strong>Gross Revenue</strong></td>
    <td>Sum of all completed orders (INR)</td>
    <td>Tracks total top-line sales volume.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><strong>Net Revenue</strong></td>
    <td>Gross Revenue minus total processed refunds</td>
    <td>Accurate cash flow after returns and cancellations.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><strong>Total Orders Placed</strong></td>
    <td>Count of all orders in system</td>
    <td>Overall order throughput.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><strong>Low Stock Alerts</strong></td>
    <td>Count of products with stock &lt; 10 units</td>
    <td>Prevents stockouts; triggers immediate replenishment.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><strong>Active Return / Refunds</strong></td>
    <td>Sum of refunds executed through Razorpay</td>
    <td>Tracks customer satisfaction and return rates.</td>
  </tr>
</table>

<h3>5.2 Product Catalog & Media Management</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Product Creation & Modification:</strong> Create, edit, and deactivate cosmetic SKUs (Name, Brand, Category, Subcategory, Price, MRP, Discount, Volume, Skin Type, Key Ingredients, How to Use).</li>
  <li><strong>Integrated Multi-Image Upload:</strong> Upload high-resolution product photos directly to the server. Images are validated, uniquely slugified, and stored in <code>/uploads/products/</code> with instant web preview.</li>
  <li><strong>Catalog Status Toggle:</strong> One-click active/inactive toggle allowing admins to temporarily delist products without deleting database records.</li>
</ul>

<h3>5.3 Batch-Level Inventory & Expiry Tracking (Pharma & Cosmetic Compliance)</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Granular Batch Management:</strong> Each product can have multiple production batches with unique batch numbers (e.g., <code>BAT-LUM-2026-01</code>).</li>
  <li><strong>Cost Price & Expiry Tracking:</strong> Record exact cost price per batch, expiry dates, supplier names, and notes.</li>
  <li><strong>Automatic FIFO Deduction:</strong> When orders are placed, the oldest unexpired batch is prioritized for stock deduction.</li>
  <li><strong>Stock Movements Audit Trail:</strong> Every manual stock addition, reduction, or sale generates an immutable audit record in the database recording who made the change, previous stock, quantity delta, and timestamp.</li>
</ul>

<h3>5.4 Order Fulfillment, Logistics & Dispatch</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Comprehensive Order Ledger:</strong> Filter orders by status (PENDING, PAID, SHIPPED, DELIVERED, CANCELLED, REFUNDED), customer search, or order reference ID.</li>
  <li><strong>1-Click Xpressbees AWB Dispatch:</strong> Clicking "Generate AWB" calls the Xpressbees courier API, books the shipment, receives a valid Air Waybill (AWB) tracking number, and assigns the courier status.</li>
  <li><strong>Thermal Shipping Label & Manifest Generation:</strong> Generate printable packing slips and shipping manifests with customer delivery details and item barcodes.</li>
  <li><strong>Instant Refund Engine:</strong> Execute partial or full refunds directly through Razorpay API. Automatically marks order as REFUNDED, records refund ID, and updates revenue metrics.</li>
</ul>

<h3>5.5 Customer Reviews Moderation</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Moderation Queue:</strong> View all customer ratings and photo reviews.</li>
  <li><strong>Profanity & Sentiment Inspection:</strong> Inspect flagged reviews containing vulgarity or toxic terms.</li>
  <li><strong>Approve / Reject Action:</strong> One-click approval publishes the review to the public storefront PDP; rejection removes it from display.</li>
</ul>

<h3>5.6 ERP & Integration Hub (Zoho, Razorpay & Xpressbees)</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Zoho Inventory / Books Sync:</strong> View live OAuth2 token connection status. Trigger 1-click batch synchronization of sales orders and products between the store and Zoho ERP.</li>
  <li><strong>Razorpay Health Monitor:</strong> Verify live key credentials, webhook signature status, and audit gateway logs.</li>
  <li><strong>Xpressbees Origin Hub:</strong> Configure origin warehouse address (Bengaluru Hub, Indiranagar), contact numbers, and default courier service levels.</li>
</ul>

