<!-- SECTION 7: SECURITY & COMPLIANCE -->
<h2>7. Security, Reliability & Compliance Features</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Cryptographic Signature Verification:</strong> All online payments verify the HMAC-SHA256 hash using the secret API key before marking an order as PAID. This eliminates tampering and simulated falsified payment requests.</li>
  <li><strong>Strict Profanity & Content Filtering:</strong> Reviews are filtered against comprehensive abusive word lists on both frontend and backend to protect brand integrity.</li>
  <li><strong>Role-Based Access Control (RBAC):</strong> Admin dashboard endpoints are restricted from general customer access.</li>
  <li><strong>Safe Stock Locking & Audit Trails:</strong> Inventory decrements occur inside Spring transactional boundaries (<code>@Transactional</code>), eliminating race conditions during flash sales.</li>
  <li><strong>Safe H2 Embedded Database Config:</strong> Configured with <code>DB_CLOSE_DELAY=-1</code> preventing lock corruption, with seamless compatibility for production migration to PostgreSQL or MySQL.</li>
</ul>

