  <li>Migrate embedded H2 database to managed <strong>PostgreSQL</strong> (e.g. Supabase, Neon, or AWS RDS).</li>
  <li>Connect live Razorpay merchant credentials and production Xpressbees courier API credentials.</li>
</ol>

